      <h3 id="smart-cloning_virt-creating-vms-by-cloning-pvcs" class="group scroll-mt-20">Smart cloning<a href="#smart-cloning_virt-creating-vms-by-cloning-pvcs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
