      <h3 id="virt-optimizing-clone-performance-at-scale-in-openshift-data-foundation_virt-creating-vms-by-cloning-pvcs" class="group scroll-mt-20">Optimizing clone Performance at scale in OpenShift Data Foundation<a href="#virt-optimizing-clone-performance-at-scale-in-openshift-data-foundation_virt-creating-vms-by-cloning-pvcs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">When you use OpenShift Data Foundation, the storage profile configures the default cloning strategy as <code>csi-clone</code>. However, this method has limitations, as shown in the following link.</p>
