      <p>To improve performance when creating hundreds of clones from a single source PVC, use the <code>VolumeSnapshot</code> cloning method instead of the default <code>csi-clone</code> strategy.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Create a <code>VolumeSnapshot</code> custom resource (CR) of the source image by using the following content:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: snapshot.storage.k8s.io/v1\nkind: VolumeSnapshot\nmetadata: \n  name: golden-volumesnapshot\n  namespace: golden-ns\nspec:\n  volumeSnapshotClassName: ocs-storagecluster-rbdplugin-snapclass\n  source:\n    persistentVolumeClaimName: golden-snap-source"} lang="yaml" />
